{"book":"hono","chapter":"getting-started","chapterTitle":"مقدمات","slug":"netlify","title":"Netlify","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"1-الإعداد","text":"1. الإعداد"},{"depth":2,"id":"2-مرحبا-بالعالم","text":"2. مرحبًا بالعالم"},{"depth":2,"id":"3-تشغيل","text":"3. تشغيل"},{"depth":2,"id":"4-النشر","text":"4. النشر"},{"depth":2,"id":"context","text":"Context"}],"html":"<p>توفر Netlify استضافة للمواقع الثابتة وخدمات خلفية (backend) بدون خادم (serverless). <a href=\"https://docs.netlify.com/edge-functions/overview/\"><code>Edge Functions</code></a> يمكّننا من جعل صفحات الويب ديناميكية.</p>\n<p>تدعم Edge Functions الكتابة بلغتي Deno و TypeScript، ويتم تسهيل النشر من خلال <a href=\"https://docs.netlify.com/cli/get-started/\"><code>Netlify CLI</code></a>. باستخدام Hono، يمكنك إنشاء التطبيق لدوال Netlify Edge Functions.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-الإعداد\">1. الإعداد</h2>\n<p>يتوفر قالب بداية لـ Netlify.\nابدأ مشروعك باستخدام الأمر &quot;create-hono&quot;.\nاختر <code>netlify</code> قالب لهذا المثال.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">npm create hono@latest my-app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">yarn create hono my-app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">pnpm create hono my-app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">bun create hono@latest my-app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">deno init --npm hono my-app\n</code></pre>\n<p>انتقل إلى <code>my-app</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-مرحبا-بالعالم\">2. مرحبًا بالعالم</h2>\n<p>تعديل <code>netlify/edge-functions/index.ts</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;jsr:@hono/hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { handle } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;jsr:@hono/netlify&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello Hono!&#x27;</span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handle</span>(app)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"3-تشغيل\">3. تشغيل</h2>\n<p>شغِّل خادم التطوير باستخدام Netlify CLI. ثم، ادخل إلى <code>http://localhost:8888</code> في متصفح الويب الخاص بك.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">netlify dev\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"4-النشر\">4. النشر</h2>\n<p>يمكنك النشر باستخدام <code>netlify deploy</code> الأمر.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-sh\">netlify deploy --prod\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"context\"><code>Context</code></h2>\n<p>يمكنك الوصول إلى خاصية Netlify <code>Context</code> عبر <code>c.env</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;jsr:@hono/hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { handle } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;jsr:@hono/netlify&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Import the type definition</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Context</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;https://edge.netlify.com/&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span> = {\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Bindings</span>: {\n    <span class=\"hljs-attr\">context</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Context</span>\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Env</span>&gt;()\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/country&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span>\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">json</span>({\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;You are in&#x27;</span>: c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">env</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">context</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">geo</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">country</span>?.<span class=\"hljs-property\">name</span>,\n  })\n)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">handle</span>(app)\n</code></pre>\n"}